:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102956","id":3066605401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62yK9Z","user":{"login":"Spirit2113","id":5604013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MDQwMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5604013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113","html_url":"https://github.com/Spirit2113","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spirit2113/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-13T05:06:02Z","updated_at":"2025-07-13T05:06:02Z","body":"`\nGodot Engine v4.4.1.stable.mono.arch_linux - https://godotengine.org\nglx: failed to create dri3 screen\nfailed to load driver: nouveau\nOpenGL API 4.6 (Core Profile) Mesa 25.1.5-cachyos1.3 - Compatibility - Using Device: AMD - AMD Radeon 680M (radeonsi, rembrandt, LLVM 20.1.7, DRM 3.63, 6.15.6-2-cachyos)\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -27648\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x6c00\n\n`\n\ncant update or use the assets store","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3066605401/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3138014085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102956#issuecomment-3138014085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102956","id":3138014085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67CkuF","user":{"login":"cannnAvar","id":72388136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMzg4MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72388136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar","html_url":"https://github.com/cannnAvar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cannnAvar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T22:30:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T22:30:51Z","body":"@Spirit2113 I had ` failed to load driver: nouveau´ error on cachy os. I fixed that with installing `linux-cachyos-nvidia-open` and `nvidia` and adding `/etc/modprobe.d/nvidia.conf` file to this line ´´´options nvidia_drm modeset=1´´´ so it's drm issue for me I can't say what is the problem for you.\n\n@akien-mga I didn't same Error on godot. I had Error like @Spirit2113 but I fix that with using godot directly on website not with package manager.   ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3138014085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477980094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102956#issuecomment-3477980094","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102956","id":3477980094,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PTcO-","user":{"login":"qezz","id":5172876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzI4NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5172876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz","html_url":"https://github.com/qezz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T13:53:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T13:53:46Z","body":"Getting the same error on one linux computer, but not on the other.\n\n```\nERROR: Cannot open X509CertificateMbedTLS file 'False'.\n   at: load (modules/mbedtls/crypto_mbedtls.cpp:160)\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -9984\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x2700\n```\n\nThere are some difference in the setup:\n\nnon problematic:\n- nixos 25.05, godot from unstable (godot-4.5.1-stable)\n- x11\n- integrated intel graphics\n\nproblematic\n- nixos unstable (godot-4.5.1-stable)\n- wayland\n- AMD dedicated GPU\n\nalso tried a godot version with some patches (unrelated to this problem), which makes nix rebuild the engine from source, but that didn't help","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477980094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477989178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102956#issuecomment-3477989178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102956","id":3477989178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PTec6","user":{"login":"qezz","id":5172876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzI4NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5172876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz","html_url":"https://github.com/qezz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T14:06:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T14:07:33Z","body":"Apparently this was the issue for me:\n\n```\n$ cat ~/.config/godot/editor_settings-4.5.tres | grep 'network/tls/editor_tls_certificates'\nnetwork/tls/editor_tls_certificates = \"False\"\n```\n\nsetting to an empty string worked\n\n```\n$ cat ~/.config/godot/editor_settings-4.5.tres | grep 'network/tls/editor_tls_certificates'\nnetwork/tls/editor_tls_certificates = \"\"\n```\n\nalso possible to do it from the editor itself\n\n<img width=\"507\" height=\"257\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47546bd9-8968-45f8-9f2d-420ee97eaefb\" />\n\n<img width=\"595\" height=\"666\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3a4c780-16fa-40b4-9324-461d0b5d152b\" />\n\nNot sure why it happens. I tried removing the editor settings file completely, to have the engine recreate them, but was ending up with the same issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477989178/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478011041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102956#issuecomment-3478011041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102956","id":3478011041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PTjyh","user":{"login":"qezz","id":5172876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzI4NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5172876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz","html_url":"https://github.com/qezz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qezz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T14:36:00Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T14:36:00Z","body":"The default TLS certs path is baked into the engine during compile time, via\n\n```\n#define _SYSTEM_CERTS_PATH ...\n```\n\nwhich apparently comes from `core/core_builders.py`:\n\n```py\ndef make_certs_header(target, source, env):\n    buffer = methods.get_buffer(str(source[0]))\n    decomp_size = len(buffer)\n    buffer = methods.compress_buffer(buffer)\n\n    with methods.generated_wrapper(str(target[0])) as file:\n        # System certs path. Editor will use them if defined. (for package maintainers)\n        file.write(f'#define _SYSTEM_CERTS_PATH \"{source[2]}\"\\n')\n        if source[1].read():\n            # Defined here and not in env so changing it does not trigger a full rebuild.\n            file.write(f\"\"\"\\\n#define BUILTIN_CERTS_ENABLED\n\ninline constexpr int _certs_compressed_size = {len(buffer)};\ninline constexpr int _certs_uncompressed_size = {decomp_size};\ninline constexpr unsigned char _certs_compressed[] = {{\n\t{methods.format_buffer(buffer, 1)}\n}};\n\"\"\")\n```\n\nwhich in its turn is called by scons in `core/SCsub`\n\n```py\n# Certificates\nenv.CommandNoCache(\n    \"#core/io/certs_compressed.gen.h\",\n    [\"#thirdparty/certs/ca-certificates.crt\", env.Value(env[\"builtin_certs\"]), env.Value(env[\"system_certs_path\"])],\n    env.Run(core_builders.make_certs_header),\n)\n```\n\nIf I understand the script correctly, the `env.Value(env[\"builtin_certs\"])` is passed to the `make_certs_header` as the second arg \"source\", and then `source[2]` returns `\"False\"`\n\nNot sure so far how to debug it further, but it's at least something","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3478011041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]